      A Text Analysis of Theft-Related Judgments and the Illusions Produced by Aggregation,
      Data, and Analytic Settings" (Masahiro Sadamura) in the open mini-symposium "The
      Potential of Local Criminology in Japan" (organised and chaired by Tomoya Mukai) at
      the 64th Annual Conference of the Japanese Association of Criminal Psychology
      (Tohoku University, Sendai) on September 20, 2026. The
      <a href="/files/sadamura_20260920_jacp64_symposium_slides.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">slides</a>
